WEBVTT

00:00:00.035 --> 00:00:03.471
A useful beginner architecture includes a simple diagram,

00:00:03.796 --> 00:00:07.918
component responsibilities, data flow, source of truth,

00:00:08.092 --> 00:00:12.225
user permissions, external integrations, failure behavior,

00:00:12.318 --> 00:00:14.013
and an operator recovery path.

00:00:14.524 --> 00:00:16.509
It also notes important alternatives.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:19.806
You do not need to select every framework to understand

00:00:19.853 --> 00:00:20.596
the design.

00:00:21.107 --> 00:00:24.125
Ask the agent to explain the diagram in everyday language,

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:28.026
then trace one successful inquiry and one failed inquiry

00:00:28.073 --> 00:00:28.549
through it.

00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:32.357
If the explanation contradicts the agreed journey, fix the

00:00:32.415 --> 00:00:34.632
design before turning it into a build contract.
